  "sourceTitle": "New Potatoes With White Sauce",
  "sourceText": "New Potatoes With White Sauce\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Sunday, December 13, 2009 - 12:39am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n4 cups sm. new potatoes\n1 tablespoon flour\n1 teaspoon salt\n1/2 teaspoon black pepper\n2 tablespoons water\n1 cup sweet milk\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Scrape potatoes and boil until done. Drain. Make white sauce using rest of ingredients. Mix well until smooth. Pour over potatoes. Bring to a boil.",
